  "steps": [
    "2 red apples, peeled and chopped, 200g dark chocolate chips.",
    "Add the peeled and chopped apples to a pot over medium heat. Cook until soft and mushy this took me about 15 minutes.",
    "Transfer the cooked apples to a blender, leaving behind any excess water.",
    "Add 200g dark chocolate chips and blend until completely smooth and creamy.",
    "Pour the mixture into a container lined with parchment paper and refrigerate for at least 4 hours, or until set.",
    "Once set, flip the container over and carefully remove the mousse cake.",
    "Dust with cocoa powder, slice, and it’s ready to serve!"
